- Will Grathwohl, Ricky T. Q. Chen, Jesse Bettencourt, Ilya Sutskever, David Duvenaud. [FFJORD: Free-form Continuous Dynamics for Scalable Reversible Generative Models](https://arxiv.org/abs/1810.01367). ICLR 2019.
- Yaron Lipman, Ricky T. Q. Chen, Heli Ben-Hamu, Maximilian Nickel, Matt Le. [Flow Matching for Generative Modeling](https://arxiv.org/abs/2210.02747). ICLR 2023.
- Xingchao Liu, Chengyue Gong, Qiang Liu. [Flow Straight and Fast: Learning to Generate and Transfer Data with Rectified Flow](https://arxiv.org/abs/2209.03003). ICLR 2023.
